# Instagram Comment-to-DM Automation

A live automation pipeline built with n8n, Meta Graph API, and ManyChat.

**What it does:** When someone comments a keyword (e.g. "info") on an Instagram post, the system automatically sends a public reply and a private DM — with zero manual effort, 24/7.

---

## The Problem

Meta completely overhauled their API and developer platform in 2024. Every existing tutorial, blog post, and YouTube walkthrough was outdated. I had to read the official Meta documentation from scratch and rebuild the entire OAuth flow and webhook setup manually.

